		{"id":"853c7a53f5db8fea","type":"text","text":"# Store-and-Forward Transmission\nBefore transmission to another destination, the switch is waiting for delivering of all packets, this process is called bufferisation\nP - part of a packet\n\n| Iterations | Destination 1 | ->  | Switch 2   | ->  | Destination 3 |\n| ---------- | ------------- | --- | ---------- | --- | ------------- |\n|            | P1, P2, P3    |     |            |     |               |\n| 1          | P1, P2        |     | P3         |     |               |\n| 2          | P1            |     | P2, P3     |     |               |\n| 3          |               |     | P1, P2, P3 |     |               |\n| 4          |               |     | P1, P2     |     | P3            |\n| 5          |               |     | P1         |     | P2, P3        |\n| 6          |               |     |            |     | P1, P2, P3    |\n\n","x":140,"y":420,"width":620,"height":424}
	],
